# Authorization Rules

All service functions that modify user-owned data must:

1. Accept a `requestingUserId` parameter
2. Verify the requesting user owns the resource before making changes
3. Throw `UnauthorizedError` if ownership check fails

Never assume the caller is authorized. Every mutation must explicitly verify permission.
